{"seq":4,"slug":"flavor-measurement-technology","title":"风味测量技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensory-evaluation-methods","title":"感官评价方法","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology/sensory-evaluation-methods","wordCount":2585,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"gc-ms-electronic-nose","title":"GC-MS 与电子鼻","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology/gc-ms-electronic-nose","wordCount":2571,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-flavor-prediction","title":"AI 风味预测","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology/ai-flavor-prediction","wordCount":2766,"readingTime":12}],"introMarkdown":"# 风味测量技术\n\n风味测量技术（Flavor Measurement Technology）涵盖从人类感官评价到高精度仪器分析的完整方法体系。风味是主观感知与客观化学的交汇点——单纯的化学分析无法完整反映人类体验，而纯粹的感官评价又缺乏分子层面的解释力。因此，现代风味研究必须整合两种路径。\n\n本章涵盖三个核心领域：感官评价方法——训练品评员的标准化主观测量技术；GC-MS 与电子鼻——将香气分子定性定量的仪器分析手段；AI 风味预测——利用机器学习和深度学习从分子结构预测感官属性的前沿技术。三者相互验证、相互补充，共同构成风味科学的证据基础。\n"}